strided split-parent destinations, SM120 qualification, and independent codec/oracle tests.

DFlash2 GGUF and NVFP4 draft projections
======================================
Adapted from melis2023/ninfer-kvmem-actkv, revision 664cb6daa8cba30dfe39b0d10113a72b20587853.
Contributor: melis2023 <zhuangisme@gmail.com>.
https://github.com/melis2023/ninfer-kvmem-actkv
Changes here: preserved current NVFP4/INT8 dispatch and Blackwell scale handling;
priced workspace for all admitted GGUF blocks; added native shape/conv oracles,
exact artifact import checks and a bounded weight-only NVFP4 conversion method.

